# Test "DIY Sale with Cash": completes a cash sale without a personal user account.
# Steps 1-3 match the smoke test. Steps 4-5 are optional: when Xstore is already signed in
# (no login form), they are skipped. Otherwise step 5 signs in with the generic developer login
# (Start Transaction is visible before sign-on, so the login must come first).
# Run with: config/localhost-shell.json (opts in to the trusted localhost HTTPS certificate).
1. Open app at "/xstoreshellapp/"
2. Use Xstore shell configuration from "../smoke/shell-configuration.json" if prompted
3. Dismiss the device error prompt if shown
4. Wait for the Xstore login screen if shown
5. Log in at the Xstore login screen using "../config/xstore-login.json" if shown
6. Click on "Start Transaction"
7. Skip customer lookup
8. Scan sale items from "sale-items.json"
9. Click on "Amount Due"
10. Note the amount due and click on "Cash"
11. Enter the exact amount due and press Enter
12. Wait for the Customer Lookup or Main Menu screen
